# ===== 视频：拖到该型号的 Release 页面，仓库 videos/ 只放自动生成的 .yml 说明 =====
*.mp4
*.mov
*.m4v
*.avi
*.mkv
*.wmv
*.flv
*.webm
*.mpg
*.mpeg

# ===== 设计源文件、印刷级原图：留在设计部存档，仓库只放网页尺寸成品 =====
*.psd
*.psb
*.ai
*.indd
*.idml
*.sketch
*.fig
*.xd
*.cdr
*.eps
*.raw
*.cr2
*.cr3
*.nef
*.arw
*.dng
*.heic

# 例外：品牌 Logo 的矢量文件需要提供给合作伙伴
!*/brand/logo/*.ai
!*/brand/logo/*.eps

# ===== 3D / 工程文件：放 documents 仓库 =====
*.stp
*.step
*.igs
*.iges
*.dwg
*.sldprt
*.sldasm

# ===== 压缩包、安装包：不入库（型号整包由程序生成） =====
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.iso
*.exe
*.dmg

# ===== 密钥与本地配置（只能放 GitHub Secrets）=====
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
.ossutilconfig
credentials*.json

# ===== Office 临时文件、系统文件 =====
~$*
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.~lock.*

# ===== 开发环境 =====
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.vscode/
.idea/

